{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object seen, approach and grab object. Process object or repeat. Scan area otherwise.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> <Action ID = GrabObject     /> <Action ID = MoveToAnotherObject     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject     /> <Action ID = ReturnToStartPosition     /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable     /> <Condition ID = IsAnotherObjectVisible     />\"",
